          "qui suivent, pas au milieu d'une expression.",
          "'GLOBAL' / 'LOCAL' must stand alone at the start of a top-level "
          "declaration line to switch the scope of the variables that follow, "
          "not in the middle of an expression.")
OWL_ERROR(E_SYNTAX_EXPECTED_TYPE_NAME, "syntax",
