          "MyWindow: forbidden in top-level of the program — no window is open "
          "at this point. Use MyWindow from a window or an event handler.")
OWL_ERROR(E_SEM_ANCETRE_OUTSIDE_METHOD, "semantic",
          "Le mot-clé 'Ancêtre' ne peut être utilisé que dans une "
